            #     refused it, leaving route (2) reachable in prose and unreachable in fact.
            #     They now read THE SAME PREDICATE, so the disagreement is structurally impossible;
            #     it derives the cause from the RED record's FACTS rather than from whether the
            #     auditor wrote the word "card". A missing injection refuses, identically to (A)
