                 f"that produced the T-11550 circular deadlock: it displaces audit custody onto a "
                 f"commit no verdict covers and leaves {tid} unable to re-audit, rebaseline OR land. "
                 f"Stage the fix and re-run, so the commit that moves custody is the one that carries "
